cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this software, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'Reference implementation of the Verifiable Data Space (VDS) and the Verifiable Anchor Delegation (VAD)'
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, test suite and benchmark harness for the Verifiable
  Data Space (VDS) and the Verifiable Anchor Delegation (VAD): signed,
  content-addressed and versioned objects that bind a verifiable credential to
  the trust configuration of the Data Space it was issued under.
authors:
  - family-names: 'Menéndez Muñoz'
    given-names: 'Rodrigo'
    affiliation: 'Universidad Politécnica de Madrid'
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: 'https://github.com/EunomiaUPM/vds'
version: '0.1.0'
keywords:
  - Data Spaces
  - Verifiable Data Space
  - Verifiable Anchor Delegation
  - Trust Configuration
  - Decentralized Identity
  - Verifiable Credentials
  - Context Binding
